<wr:import inline='true' url="$\{CUMULOB\}" />\par
\pard\qj\par
Vista l'ordinanza N. <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/NumeroOrdinanza"/>/<wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/AnnoOrdinanza"/> emessa in data <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/DataEmissioneOrdinanza"/> da <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/DescrUfficioEmittente"/> di <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/DescrLuogoEmittente"/> che ha<wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='C']"> \b concesso\b0  <wr:if select="/X/Soggetto[Sesso=&apos;M&apos;]">al condannato <wr:else/>alla condannata </wr:if>giorni totali \b <wr:function select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata\lang3082 [FlagConcesso='C']\lang1040 /NumeroGiorni" function=\ldblquote SUM\rdblquote /> \lang3082\b0 di liberazione anticipata\lang1040  <wr:if select="count(/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='C'])&gt;1">(di cui <wr:else/>(</wr:if><wr:forEach select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='C']">n.ro giorni \b <wr:out select="./NumeroGiorni"/>\b0  \b <wr:if select=".[DescrStatoPermesso\b0 =&apos;LI&apos;]"\b >di Integrazione Liberazione Anticipata\b0 <wr:else/>\b <wr:if select=".[DescrStatoPermesso\b0 =&apos;LS&apos;]"\b >di Liberazione Anticipata Speciale\b0 <wr:else/>\b <wr:if select=".[DescrStatoPermesso\b0 =&apos;LA&apos;]"\b >di Liberazione Anticipata\b0 <wr:else/>di Liberazione Anticipata\b </wr:if></wr:if></wr:if>\b0 <wr:if select="./PeriodoLibAnticipata"><wr:if select="count(./PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='C'])&gt;1"> in riferimento ai periodi<wr:else/> in riferimento al periodo</wr:if><wr:forEach select="./PeriodoLibAnticipata">, dal <wr:out select="./DataInizio"/> al <wr:out select="./DataFine"/>, </wr:forEach></wr:if></wr:forEach>)</wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='R']"> \par
\pard\sb120\qj\b rigetta\b0 <wr:if select="count(/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='R']) &gt;1"> periodi<wr:else/> periodo</wr:if><wr:forEach select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='R']">, dal <wr:out select="./DataInizio"/> al <wr:out select="./DataFine"/></wr:forEach></wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='I']"> \par
\pard\qj\b dichiara inammissibile\b0 <wr:if select="count(/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='I']) &gt;1"> periodi<wr:else/> periodo</wr:if><wr:forEach select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='I']">, dal <wr:out select="./DataInizio"/> al <wr:out select="./DataFine"/></wr:forEach></wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='N']"> \par
\pard\b N.L.P./N.D.P.\b0 <wr:if select="count(/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='N']) &gt;1"> periodi<wr:else/> periodo</wr:if><wr:forEach select="/X/FascicoloSiep/LicenzaLibAnticipata/PeriodoLibAnticipata[FlagConcesso='N']">, dal <wr:out select="./DataInizio"/> al <wr:out select="./DataFine"/></wr:forEach></wr:if><wr:query select="/X/Evento[EventoCorrente=&apos;S&apos;]" var="EveCorr"/><wr:if select="$\{EveCorr\}/Fungibilita">\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\qc\b RILEVATO\par
\pard\b0 che il fine pena \'e8 anticipato al \b <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFine"/>\b0 <wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione">(\b *)\b0 </wr:if>, calcolato detraendo l\rquote intero periodo di liberazione anticipata\par
\pard\sb120\qj <wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione">\par
\pard\b (*) \b0 Scadenza reclusione <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione"/></wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataInizioArresto"><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione"\b >\b0  - <wr:else/>\par
\pard\sb120\b (*) \b0 </wr:if\b >\b0 Decorrenza arresto <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataInizioArresto"/></wr:if>\par
\pard\sb200\sa200\qc\b ORDINA\par
\pard\qj\b0 <wr:if select="$\{EveCorr\}/Fungibilita[DataOdierna=&apos;S&apos;]">L\rquote immediata scarcerazione <wr:if select="/X/Soggetto[Sesso=&apos;M&apos;]">del condannato<wr:else/>della condannata</wr:if><wr:else/>La scarcerazione alla data \b <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFine"/>\b0 </wr:if> se non<wr:if select="/X/Soggetto[Sesso=&apos;M&apos;]"> detenuto <wr:else/> detenuta </wr:if>per altra causa\par
<wr:import inline='true' url="$\{ESECUZIONEMISURASICUREZZA\}" />\par
\pard\sb140\sa140\qc\b COMUNICA\par
\pard\b0 che <wr:if select="/X/Soggetto[Sesso=&apos;M&apos;]">il condannato<wr:else/>la condannata</wr:if> ha espiato un periodo di pena in eccesso pari a<wr:if select="$\{EveCorr\}/Fungibilita/StringaFungibilita">\b <wr:out select="$\{EveCorr\}/Fungibilita/StringaFungibilita"/>\b0 </wr:if><wr:else/>\par
\pard\sb140\sa140\qc\b COMUNICA\par
\pard\qj\b0 che la data di fine pena, gi\'e0 fissata al <wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaPrecedente[FlagErgastolo=&apos;S&apos;]">MAI</wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaPrecedente[FlagErgastolo=&apos;D&apos;]">MAI</wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaPrecedente[FlagErgastolo=&apos;N&apos;]"><wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaPrecedente/DataFine"/></wr:if> \'e8 anticipata<wr:if select="/X[W-Fungibilita=&apos;S&apos;]"> \b in data odierna\b0 , data in cui dovr\'e0 essere scarcerato se non detenuto per altra causa; <wr:else/> al\b  \b0 <wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua[FlagErgastolo=&apos;S&apos;]">MAI</wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua[FlagErgastolo=&apos;D&apos;]">MAI</wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua[FlagErgastolo=&apos;N&apos;]">\b <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFine"/>\b0 </wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione">(\b *)\b0 </wr:if>, data in cui dovr\'e0 essere <wr:if select="/X/Soggetto[Sesso=&apos;M&apos;]">scarcerato se non detenuto <wr:else/>scarcerata se non detenuta </wr:if>per altra causa;\par
<wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione">\par
\pard\sb120\b (*) \b0 Scadenza reclusione <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione"/></wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataInizioArresto"><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataFineReclusione"\b >\b0  - <wr:else/>\par
\b (*) \b0 </wr:if\b >\b0 Decorrenza arresto <wr:out select="/X/FascicoloSiep/PenaResidua/DataInizioArresto"/></wr:if></wr:if>\par
\pard\qj </wr:if><wr:if select="/X/FascicoloSiep/MisuraSicurezza">\par
